=item y - reference to a scalar holding number, pointer object or undef. a pointer to receive the y mouse delta accumulated since last call, can be NULL if unused.

=back

Returns unsigned integer: a 32-bit bitmask of the button state that can be bitwise-compared against the SDL_BUTTON_MASK(X) macro.

Since: This function is available since SDL 3.2.0.

