=head1 ENUMERATIONS

Every enumerator is exported as a constant sub.

=head2 SDL_SystemCursor

Cursor types for SDL_CreateSystemCursor().

=over

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_DEFAULT = 0 - Default cursor. Usually an arrow.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_TEXT = 1 - Text selection. Usually an I-beam.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_WAIT = 2 - Wait. Usually an hourglass or watch or spinning ball.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_CROSSHAIR = 3 - Crosshair.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_PROGRESS = 4 - Program is busy but still interactive. Usually it's WAIT with an arrow.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_NWSE_RESIZE = 5 - Double arrow pointing northwest and southeast.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_NESW_RESIZE = 6 - Double arrow pointing northeast and southwest.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_EW_RESIZE = 7 - Double arrow pointing west and east.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_NS_RESIZE = 8 - Double arrow pointing north and south.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_MOVE = 9 - Four pointed arrow pointing north, south, east, and west.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_NOT_ALLOWED = 10 - Not permitted. Usually a slashed circle or crossbones.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_POINTER = 11 - Pointer that indicates a link. Usually a pointing hand.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_NW_RESIZE = 12 - Window resize top-left. This may be a single arrow or a double arrow like NWSE_RESIZE.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_N_RESIZE = 13 - Window resize top. May be NS_RESIZE.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_NE_RESIZE = 14 - Window resize top-right. May be NESW_RESIZE.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_E_RESIZE = 15 - Window resize right. May be EW_RESIZE.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_SE_RESIZE = 16 - Window resize bottom-right. May be NWSE_RESIZE.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_S_RESIZE = 17 - Window resize bottom. May be NS_RESIZE.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_SW_RESIZE = 18 - Window resize bottom-left. May be NESW_RESIZE.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_W_RESIZE = 19 - Window resize left. May be EW_RESIZE.

=item SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_COUNT = 20

=back

=head2 SDL_MouseWheelDirection

Scroll direction types for the Scroll event

